repository-code: "https://github.com/artlostintime/euterpe"
abstract: >-
  Local-first music recommendation runtime: decayed-frequency repeat
  engine, item2vec discovery engine with product-quantized ADC serving,
  MBID resolver, ListenBrainz importer, context weighting, and opt-in
  contribution. Trained and evaluated on MLHD+ (1.68 billion sanitized
  listening events, 36,970 users, 2.8M recordings).
keywords:
  - music
  - recommendation
  - item2vec
  - product-quantization
  - local-first
  - on-device
  - MLHD
